description.text:
One single piercing jump attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants [Instant ATB 1], [Instant Cast 1] to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & ATB Speed x1.2 to Wind Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if user has at least Lv.0/2 En-Wind;
WS Blue: [Lv.2 En-Wind Stack]
WS Gold: [During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 3 & Damage +50% to Wind Abilities]

